    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome in this casual action game of Runebound Bastion. You are an adventurer who has discovered magical crystals deep within ancient lands. These crystals are your only hope to stop the hordes of monsters that have awakened in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main mission is to pass succesful\u00a0 all the waves. To create more crystals and strengthen them, you must collect special runes scattered across the world. A clever fox will assist you in this task \u2014 but he only works in exchange for a few runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crystal can be upgraded to attack faster and deal more damage, helping you hold back stronger waves of enemies. Your strategy and choices will decide whether the world is saved or consumed by darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel-art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet engaging gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal upgrades and rune collecting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple waves</p></li></ul>",
